//     WalkDir (Int) and Attack (Trigger), the three parameters 1.6 built.
//     No climb clip or climb pose exists anywhere in Assets/.
//
// PROTECTED BLOCKS — ids are POSITIONAL (src/lib/formify.ts), so nothing here
// is reordered, renumbered or re-counted. The ids this page produced at HEAD,
